Support neutron agent wrappers in neutron-ovn-agent

Neutron has removed the standalone OVN metadata agent, so metadata is now
served by the metadata extension of neutron-ovn-agent. Give that image the
same extend_start.sh as neutron-metadata-agent, so that its HAProxy
processes can run in separate containers and survive agent restarts.

